  <div class="page">
    <div class="page__head">
      <p class="page__kicker">[ EVERYONE'S IN THE PACK ]</p>
      <h1 class="page__title">Accessibility</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Stray Dog Clothing aims to meet WCAG 2.1 AA across this site. The pack includes everyone.</p>
      <h2>What we've done</h2>
      <ul class="mono-list">
        <li>[ ✓ ] Keyboard-navigable menus, accordions &amp; forms</li>
        <li>[ ✓ ] Alt text on all product and editorial images</li>
        <li>[ ✓ ] Minimum 4.5:1 contrast on body text</li>
        <li>[ ✓ ] No content hidden behind hover-only interactions</li>
        <li>[ ✓ ] Responsive layouts — usable at 400% zoom</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Known gaps</h2>
      <p>Carousel content is horizontally scrollable and may announce awkwardly in some screen readers — every item also appears on the shop page.</p>
      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>Hit a barrier? Tell us via the <a href="/pages/contact" style="text-decoration:underline">contact page</a> — we fix accessibility issues as priority bugs.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

